## Troubleshooting

### "Metadata kept in Windows cache, refused to mount"

This error means the drive was not cleanly unmounted from Windows. Options:

1. Boot into Windows and run `chkdsk /f D:`
2. Or force-mount (data loss risk): `mount -t ntfs-3g -o remove_hiberfile /dev/sdb1 /mnt/data`

